irect behavioral evidence. inventory-api was managed and healthy before the OOM test, served every captured probe while the kernel killed the intended memory hog, and remained healthy afterward. The provider-wide restart protocol was complete: it captured a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity, restart acknowledgement, a different post-restart identity, and recovered service, configuration, listener, health, and inventory data. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["Four temporary evidence files remained in /tmp after execution.","The lifecycle collector does not support systemd failed-unit checks on Alpine; this is not contradictory because the managed service uses OpenRC."]}
